	"notice": "Match the MIDI receive channel and playing mode to the controller using the model manual. MPE and polyphonic aftertouch require suitable controller and instrument configuration. The panel uses shifted functions; slider labels alone do not define fixed CC mappings. USB carries MIDI and power. Exact browser MIDI port aliases have not been verified; select this profile manually. DIN-connected hardware appears under the MIDI interface name. Physical controls are unbound and this profile does not supply a complete MIDI implementation. Diagrams show selected physical controls with illustrative positions; consult the linked manufacturer references for the full panel.",
